      "writtenOn": "2022-02-17T05:59:04Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Hey Zichar: In the future, this sort of early patch review is probably better done over private email (via git send-email), and after that its probably best to just send the patch to the list (rather then submitting to Gerrit) for discussion.\n\nAs the android-mainline branch already has wakeup reason functionality, and the goal here is to upstream this functionality, its would be less confusing to the android tree maintainers (who automatically get cc\u0027ed) to avoid submitting them to gerrit and instead focus the discussion on the list.",
      "revId": "6def5d36268dab5af80f5df94979ba84ffe5b8ee",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
