      "writtenOn": "2022-02-17T05:59:04Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "In this case, if things are very wrong, it looks like you might call irq_err_record() multiple times for a single call to irq_check_error(). \n\nThough the irq_error_record() can only note a single error at a time.\n\nShould this be a if () {} else if () {} else if (){ } statement instead (or should multiple errors be reported on a single call here)?",
      "revId": "6def5d36268dab5af80f5df94979ba84ffe5b8ee",
